[{"id":3517199077,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7RpDLl","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. This will be very helpful to improve battery life and reduce heat/noise emissions when working on a laptop or Android device.\r\n\r\nIt successfully prevents continuous updates with CPUParticles (2D + 3D), GPUParticles (2D + 3D) and shaders using `TIME`. However, it won't help if you have an AnimationPlayer or AnimationTree currently playing an animation (e.g. `red_robot.tscn` in the TPS demo).\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- Having **View Information** or **View Frame Time** enabled in the 3D viewport's Perspective menu will still cause the viewport to update continuously. This is definitely a bug in the former case (we should fix it in a separate PR). In the latter case, it's more debatable whether we want this to happen on purpose (the measurement is only accurate if we force continuous redrawing while the frame time panel is visible).\r\n\r\n- The editor occasionally seems to freeze for 0.1-0.5 seconds when alt-tabbing back in when using **Update Vital Changes**. This also can happen when trying to use dropdowns, or trying to move the mouse with freelook. I didn't manage to find precise reproduction steps for this.\r\n\r\n- When the project is running, we could make the editor automatically use **Update Vital Changes** until the project is stopped. This way, it doesn't take away CPU/GPU resources from the running project. This can be implemented in a future PR.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224#pullrequestreview-3517199077","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113224","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224#pullrequestreview-3517199077"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113224"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-28T00:51:06Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3518200149,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Rs3lV","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public